  "description": "Suggests the decided attributes of a record from the records already settled, and says how often a suggestion it trusts is right: values settled together, similar settled records, thresholds chosen by replaying them. No model needed. The decision core is native (Rust) and called through its C ABI; schemas, records and answers are typed .NET values.",
